// Isle native resources.
//
// IMPORTANT: Do not embed app.manifest here as RT_MANIFEST. The manifest is
// merged and embedded by the MSVC linker via /MANIFESTINPUT in CMakeLists.txt.
// Adding `1 RT_MANIFEST "app.manifest"` here duplicates manifest resource ID 1
// and causes CVTRES fatal error CVT1100.
//
// Future non-manifest resources (for example an application icon) can live
// here when this file is added back to the Isle target.
